WEBVTT

00:05:29.076 --> 00:05:33.319
in a petition to be sent to the king to release me.

00:05:33.319 --> 00:05:35.103
I was released after nine days.

00:05:35.103 --> 00:05:37.789
June 17 comes.

00:05:37.789 --> 00:05:40.479
The streets were packed with police cars

00:05:40.479 --> 00:05:42.640
and religious police cars,

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:44.943
but some hundred brave Saudi women

00:05:44.943 --> 00:05:46.975
broke the ban and drove that day.

00:05:46.975 --> 00:05:50.063
None were arrested. We broke the taboo.

00:05:50.063 --> 00:05:55.406
(Applause)